const serviceLabels={physical:'Физическая охрана',access:'Пропускной режим',video:'Видеонаблюдение',armed:'Вооружённая охрана',cargo:'Сопровождение грузов'};
const actionLabels={read:'Просмотр',create:'Создание',update:'Изменение',delete:'Удаление',export:'Экспорт',download:'Скачивание',review:'Проверка',publish:'Публикация',pin:'Закреп',replace:'Замена',override:'Ручное решение',confirm:'Подтверждение',acknowledge:'Ознакомление',sensitive:'Чувствительные сведения','*':'Все действия'};
function permissionLabel(p){if(p==='*')return'Полный доступ';const [k,a]=p.split('.');return name(k)+' · '+(actionLabels[a]||'Дополнительное действие');}
function cell(key,value){
 if(value===null||value===undefined||value==='')return'—';if(['status','scan_status','severity','event_type','decision'].includes(key))return badge(value);if(key==='role')return esc(roles[value]||'Пользовательская роль');
 if(['created_at','updated_at','starts_at','ends_at','server_time','client_time','deadline','sent_at','finished_at','confirmed_at','acknowledged_at','published_at'].includes(key))return esc(date(value));if(key==='published')return badge(Number(value)?'PUBLISHED':'DRAFT');if(['offline','legacy','is_working','working_days'].includes(key))return Number(value)?'Да':'Нет';if(key==='pinned_rank')return value?`<span class="status green">Закреп №${num(value)}</span>`:'Без закрепа';
 if(key.endsWith('_id')){const kind=S.schema?.references[key];return esc(S.refs[kind]?.find(x=>x.id===value)?.name||'Связанная запись');}
 if(Array.isArray(value)){if(key==='services')return esc(value.map(x=>serviceLabels[x]||'Другая услуга').join(', '));if(key==='permissions')return value.map(p=>`<span class="detail-tag">${esc(permissionLabel(p))}</span>`).join('');if(key==='required_fields')return esc(value.map(x=>label(x)).join(', '));if(key==='weekdays')return esc(value.map(x=>['','Пн','Вт','Ср','Чт','Пт','Сб','Вс'][Number(x)]).join(', '));if(key==='polygon')return value.length?`${num(value.length)} точек · на карте`:'Круговая геозона';return esc(value.map(x=>typeof x==='object'?'Сведения':String(x)).join(', '));}
 if(value&&typeof value==='object')return`<div class="structured-values">${Object.entries(value).map(([k,v])=>`<div><span>${esc(label(k))}</span><strong>${typeof v==='boolean'?(v?'Да':'Нет'):typeof v==='object'?'Сохранено':esc(v)}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div>`;
 if(key.includes('salary')||key==='amount')return num(value)+' ₽';if(key==='qualification')return'Разряд '+num(value);return esc(String(value).slice(0,300));
}
function field(key,type,value,kind){
 if(['services','required_fields','permissions','weekdays'].includes(key)){
  let choices=key==='services'?Object.entries(serviceLabels):key==='required_fields'?['number','issued_at','expires_at','name'].map(k=>[k,label(k)]):key==='weekdays'?[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(x=>[String(x),['','Понедельник','Вторник','Среда','Четверг','Пятница','Суббота','Воскресенье'][x]]):[['*','Полный доступ'],...Object.keys(S.schema.names).flatMap(k=>['read','create','update','delete','export','download'].map(a=>[k+'.'+a,permissionLabel(k+'.'+a)]))];
  return`<fieldset class="choice-field full"><legend>${esc(label(key,kind))}</legend><div class="choice-grid ${key==='permissions'?'permission-grid':''}">${choices.map(([v,title])=>`<label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="${key}" value="${v}" ${(value||[]).map(String).includes(v)?'checked':''}><span>${esc(title)}</span></label>`).join('')}</div></fieldset>`;
 }
 if(['decision','severity'].includes(key)){const values=key==='decision'?['VALID','REJECTED']:['LOW','MEDIUM','HIGH','CRITICAL'];return`<label>${esc(label(key,kind))}<select name="${key}" required>${values.map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===value?'selected':''}>${esc(statuses[v])}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`;}
 if(key==='language')return`<label>Язык интерфейса<select name="language"><option value="ru">Русский</option></select></label>`;
 if(key==='reminder_days')return`<label>Дни напоминаний<input name="reminder_days" value="${esc((value||[30,14,7,1]).join(', '))}" placeholder="30, 14, 7, 1"><small>Число дней до окончания срока, через запятую</small></label>`;
 if(key==='version')return`<input type="hidden" name="version" value="${Number(value)||1}">`;
 let html=originalField(key,type,value,kind);const old=S.schema?.labels[key]||key;html=html.replace('>'+esc(old)+'<','>'+esc(label(key,kind))+'<');return html;
}
function readForm(form,fields){const data=originalReadForm(form,fields),fd=new FormData(form);for(const key of ['services','required_fields','permissions','weekdays'])if(form.querySelector(`[name="${key}"]`))data[key]=fd.getAll(key).map(x=>key==='weekdays'?Number(x):x);if(fd.has('reminder_days'))data.reminder_days=String(fd.get('reminder_days')).split(',').map(v=>Number(v.trim())).filter(Number.isFinite);return data;}
